# AngularJS

- One file per controller/service: `Scripts/app/controllers/{module}Controller.js`, `Scripts/app/services/{module}Service.js`.
- Register on `myApp`. Controllers talk only to their service. Services use `$http`.
- Load page scripts in the Razor `@section scripts`, not in `_Layout` (except `app.js`).
- POSTs rely on the `app.js` interceptor for `RequestVerificationToken`.
- Handle `{ success, data, errors }` and `data.NeedsJob`.
- Keep `$scope` style (no components). Do not add ui-router.

```javascript
app.service('inventoryService', function ($http) {
    this.list = function (params) {
        return $http.get('/Inventory/List', { params: params });
    };
});
```
